[CHANGE] benchmark_1/parts/task_queue/pretense/task_worker_impl_pretense.py: Implement TaskWorker impl pseudo-state machine with call_target overrides for execute/fetch/reset/properties, real checked scenarios seeded via collaborator queue including failure path, and real Hypothesis fuzzing.
[CHANGE] benchmark_1/parts/task_queue/lib/task_worker_impl.py: Fix feedback: fetch_and_execute now runs the full execution path (self.execute) after a successful dispatch when the collaborator dispatch did not already drive this worker, so queue.complete is invoked, _last_task_id/_processed_count telemetry updates, and the busy-state transition occurs before returning the task identifier; dispatch-driven execution is not duplicated
